{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "agora-integration-cart-v2",
    "name": "AGORA - Integration Cart (crear, ítems, gestión)",
    "description": "Carrito de integración para n8n / WhatsApp.\n\n**Base:** `{{baseUrl}}` sin `/api` (ej. `http://localhost:3000`).\n\n**Auth (una de dos):**\n- Header `X-Webhook-Secret: {{webhookSecret}}`\n- Header `Authorization: Bearer {{webhookSecret}}`\n\n**Variables de colección:** `webhookSecret`, `storeId`, `cartId`, `productId`, `branchId`, `itemId`.\n\n> `branchId` es obligatorio en altas de ítems (`POST /integrations/cart/:cartId/items`).\n\nTras **Crear carrito** y **Agregar ítem**, los tests guardan `cartId` e `itemId` en variables de colección.\n\n**Docs:** `docs/integrations/integration-cart-api.md`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "webhookSecret", "value": "" },
    { "key": "storeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cartId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "itemId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "branchId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Crear y consultar carrito",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Crear carrito",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j && j.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cartId', j.id);",
                  "    console.log('cartId guardado:', j.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"storeId\": \"{{storeId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Body: `storeId` = UUID de `core.stores`. Respuesta 201 incluye `id` del carrito.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Obtener carrito (con ítems)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "description": "Devuelve carrito, líneas enriquecidas, `subtotal`, `itemCount`, `totalQuantity`. 410 si expiró.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Eliminar carrito completo",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "description": "Borra el carrito y sus ítems.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Gestionar ítems",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Agregar ítem (requerido)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j && j.items && j.items.length) {",
                  "    const last = j.items[j.items.length - 1];",
                  "    if (last.id) {",
                  "      pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', last.id);",
                  "      console.log('itemId guardado:', last.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"branchId\": \"{{branchId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Si la misma línea (producto + variantes + notas + branch) ya existe, suma cantidad. `branchId` es obligatorio en todos los casos.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Agregar ítem (branch + variantes + notas)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j && j.items && j.items.length) {",
                  "    const last = j.items[j.items.length - 1];",
                  "    if (last.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', last.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"{{productId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"branchId\": \"{{branchId}}\",\n  \"variantSelections\": {\n    \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002\"\n  },\n  \"specialInstructions\": \"Ejemplo de nota\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Ajusta UUIDs de `variantSelections` a IDs reales de tu catálogo. `branchId` es obligatorio.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Cantidad absoluta",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "description": "Envía `quantity` y/o `quantityDelta`. Si el total es ≤ 0, elimina el ítem (y el carrito si queda vacío).",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items/{{itemId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Cantidad delta",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantityDelta\": -1\n}"
            },
            "description": "Incrementa o decrementa respecto a la cantidad actual.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items/{{itemId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Quitar ítem",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "description": "Elimina la línea. Si era el último ítem, puede borrarse el carrito (respuesta null según implementación).",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/items/{{itemId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Enlace al sitio (WhatsApp)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Generar link público",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ttlSeconds\": 604800,\n  \"path\": \"/carrito/integracion\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Requiere `FRONTEND_URL` en el backend. Respuesta: `url`, `token`, `link_expires_at`. Body vacío `{}` usa defaults.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/link"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Generar link público (query)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "{{webhookSecret}}" }],
            "description": "Opcional: `?ttlSeconds=604800&path=/carrito/integracion`",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart/{{cartId}}/link?ttlSeconds=604800"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Auth con Bearer (alternativa)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Crear carrito (Authorization Bearer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j && j.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('cartId', j.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{webhookSecret}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"storeId\": \"{{storeId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Misma clave que `X-Webhook-Secret`, en header Bearer.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/integrations/cart"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
